      "writtenOn": "2024-01-23T20:35:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I think we will need these once we have multiple prebuilt apexes in the tree.\n\nI\u0027m still missing something.\n\nIn `apex/prebuilt.go`, you added an early return:\n\n```\n// If this prebuilt apex has not been selected, return\nif p.IsHideFromMake() {\n  return\n}\n```\n\nWith that early return, `dexpreoptSystemServerJars` is only called for the selected apexes. Then the call goes through `dexpreoptSystemServerJars` -\u003e `DexpreoptPrebuiltApexSystemServerJars` -\u003e `dexpreopt` -\u003e `GenerateDexpreoptRule` -\u003e `dexpreoptCommand`, so `dexpreoptCommand` is only called for the sscp jars of the selected apexes.\n\nWithout your other changes in this CL, only the right sscp jars are copied by `dexpreoptCommand`.\n\nTherefore, do you still need other changes in this CL? Or will it work if you only keep the early return and revert other changes?",
      "parentUuid": "49204612_6d89e7e6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 74
      },
      "revId": "3e7c90b60914ee2801bb437ab3bc1f705dc020b6",
